# GitHub Packages — CWL language pin (example)

Copy to **`.npmrc`** in the Convert root (gitignored). Do not commit tokens.

```ini
@agenticop-io:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
```

Then optionally:

```json
"@agenticop-io/cwl": "1.0.13"
```

Default sibling pin stays:

```json
"@chrysalis/cwl": "file:../chrysalis-cwl/packages/cwl"
```

See [`docs/CONVERT-CWL-CONSUME.md`](docs/CONVERT-CWL-CONSUME.md) · CWL [`docs/language/CWL-PUBLISH.md`](../chrysalis-cwl/docs/language/CWL-PUBLISH.md).
